WEBVTT

00:08.700 --> 00:12.500
When we went to the zoo 
before, we had bread.

00:12.500 --> 00:13.610
Today we'll have rice balls.

00:19.520 --> 00:20.790
There.

00:23.220 --> 00:26.130
Also... some apples.

00:33.270 --> 00:34.880
Good morning, Goshiki-san.

00:35.220 --> 00:36.960
Oh, yes.

00:42.770 --> 00:44.770
Good morning.

00:45.870 --> 00:47.900
<i>I-I'm in love!</i>

00:50.820 --> 00:52.020
Hey.

00:52.230 --> 00:54.490
We're going out today.

00:54.970 --> 00:57.230
There are plenty of apples, 
so feel free to have some.

01:02.380 --> 01:03.780
I will, thank you.

01:04.480 --> 01:09.340
<i>Ever since I gave her that letter,
 or rough draft, rather,</i>

01:09.340 --> 01:11.630
<i>she hasn't looked me in the eye much.</i>

01:12.960 --> 01:16.840
You have plenty of wonderful 
traits the way you are!

01:17.950 --> 01:21.810
Um, I could pare that apple 
for you if you like.

01:22.270 --> 01:24.170
No, thank you.

01:24.170 --> 01:26.190
I'll do it myself later.

01:26.190 --> 01:27.830
All right.

01:29.020 --> 01:31.880
<i>Maybe she </i>was<i> embarrassed after all.</i>

01:40.860 --> 01:42.820
I'll treasure it.

01:46.610 --> 01:48.500
<i>It's embarrassing for me, too.</i>

01:51.860 --> 01:54.330
I'm going to go check on everyone.

02:02.430 --> 02:05.130
Chibi-chan! Will you be ready to go soon?

02:05.770 --> 02:07.860
Yep, I'm good.

02:08.920 --> 02:11.520
Sorry for making you come along.

02:11.520 --> 02:12.620
It's fine.

02:13.280 --> 02:14.930
Machi, Fumio.

02:16.250 --> 02:17.230
Huh?

02:23.520 --> 02:25.080
What're you doing?

02:25.080 --> 02:29.380
It was like, Fumio was holding 
her hand, so I got in on it, too.

02:29.770 --> 02:33.510
Fumio, we're about to visit Dad's grave.

02:33.510 --> 02:35.390
You can play with her some other time.

02:35.390 --> 02:36.680
No.

02:37.020 --> 02:38.550
A grave visit?

02:39.160 --> 02:41.960
Would Goshiki-san enjoy that, 
even if we invited her?

02:43.470 --> 02:47.770
If it wouldn't be any trouble, 
why don't I go with you?

03:01.240 --> 03:08.540
Looks like it started before I knew it

03:09.290 --> 03:14.340
Thanks to you, I'm all smiles

03:16.250 --> 03:24.300
The usual townscape lends 
charm to the two of us

03:24.300 --> 03:29.810
Funny how it looks like a starry sky

03:33.560 --> 03:35.650
Suddenly buying flowers

03:35.650 --> 03:37.650
Standing around in the kitchen

03:37.650 --> 03:40.860
Sending a photo, because 
the setting sun is pretty

03:40.860 --> 03:45.410
Trying to spend as much 
time with you as I can

03:45.410 --> 03:48.410
This is all new for me

03:50.290 --> 03:55.960
I hope tomorrow is like today

03:56.290 --> 04:02.510
I've never felt this way before

04:02.510 --> 04:08.100
We'll go on a date this weekend if possible

04:08.760 --> 04:14.020
But it's fine if we stay home

04:15.270 --> 04:18.480
I can't wait to see you

04:20.990 --> 04:25.990
<b><b>Episode 7</b></b>

04:20.990 --> 04:25.990
<b>A Slight Fever with the Princess</b>

04:33.350 --> 04:35.610
It isn't too far away.

04:35.880 --> 04:39.070
Nope. That's why we come hang out sometimes.

04:39.750 --> 04:43.590
<i>She ended up coming with us, 
but is that a good thing?</i>

04:46.550 --> 04:50.390
<b>Kuga Family Grave</b>

04:50.400 --> 04:51.990
Place the flowers like this?

04:51.990 --> 04:52.740
Yeah.

04:52.740 --> 04:54.290
I'll change out the water.

04:54.290 --> 04:55.640
Thank you.

04:55.640 --> 04:56.970
The liquor?

04:56.970 --> 05:00.510
We'll bring it back when we're 
done, so just set it there.

05:07.480 --> 05:09.040
Let's see...

05:09.470 --> 05:11.520
The whole family is doing well.

05:12.070 --> 05:14.790
Machi has grown by five centimeters.

05:15.070 --> 05:19.490
Lately, I've been thinking maybe 
I'll study astrology stuff.

05:19.980 --> 05:21.540
Oh my, lovely.

05:22.100 --> 05:27.930
Fumio still loves illustrated reference books, 
and he's started trying to make his own.

05:28.550 --> 05:30.550
Which is wonderful.

05:30.550 --> 05:33.310
I came along too, Uncle.

05:33.780 --> 05:38.390
We're all doing well, so please 
watch over us free of concern.

05:38.810 --> 05:41.690
<b>Kuga Family Grave</b>

05:48.840 --> 05:51.080
Okay, let's go eat.

05:51.390 --> 05:52.960
Withdraw!

05:55.300 --> 05:56.480
Wait up!

06:02.580 --> 06:04.700
Oh, a picnic!

06:04.700 --> 06:05.680
Yeah.

06:07.140 --> 06:09.680
I figured we'd have one before it gets cold.

06:09.680 --> 06:11.730
Lucky for us the weather's nice.

06:12.780 --> 06:16.850
We always eat interesting food 
after we visit the grave!

06:16.850 --> 06:19.500
It's not a rule or anything,

06:19.500 --> 06:23.210
but we figure it's best for one 
part of this to be enjoyable.

06:23.210 --> 06:24.480
That makes sense.

06:25.120 --> 06:27.080
Time to eat!

06:29.620 --> 06:31.150
It's good!

06:31.150 --> 06:32.880
Glad to hear it.

06:33.200 --> 06:35.160
This <i>is</i> enjoyable.

06:37.720 --> 06:40.140
Last time, I had Indian 
curry for the first time!

06:40.140 --> 06:43.520
Wasn't that butter chicken 
stuff yummy, Fumio?

06:43.520 --> 06:44.750
Yum-yum.

06:44.750 --> 06:47.520
I only come when I can.

06:47.520 --> 06:51.780
Oh, I think you manage 
to make it all the time.

06:51.780 --> 06:52.760
Thanks.

06:52.760 --> 06:55.260
Well, I mean, it's fun after all.

06:55.560 --> 06:57.510
Chibi-chan, you get embarrassed so easily.

06:57.890 --> 07:00.870
That goes for Goshiki-san, too.

07:00.870 --> 07:04.000
I mean, I'm a relative if nothing else.

07:04.000 --> 07:06.900
But Goshiki-san is Ichiro's girlfriend!

07:08.100 --> 07:10.010
They said they're dating!

07:14.020 --> 07:16.470
M-Machi, don't go blabbing that!

07:16.470 --> 07:17.580
What? Can't I say it?

07:17.580 --> 07:19.290
Yes, you can, but...

07:23.040 --> 07:25.920
Here, have a manju bun from Kotoriya.

07:25.920 --> 07:27.290
You got it!

07:27.600 --> 07:31.030
Um, it's not that we were hiding it.

07:31.030 --> 07:34.620
Yeah, I did have my suspicions.

07:34.620 --> 07:36.670
You two make a good couple.

07:36.670 --> 07:38.120
A-Are you sure?!

07:38.120 --> 07:39.780
Oh, that makes me happy!

07:40.800 --> 07:43.310
I-I'm happy, too...

07:43.310 --> 07:44.550
Oh, my!

07:45.510 --> 07:50.060
<i>I mean, Ichiro-kun's like a 
big brother to me anyway...</i>

07:50.400 --> 07:53.580
Dad sure did love these manju buns.

07:53.580 --> 07:56.450
He liked sweet things and liquor.

07:56.450 --> 08:02.220
He worked and played so hard. 
I used to wonder when he ever slept.

08:02.840 --> 08:07.580
It's too bad he wouldn't go 
see the doctor more often.

08:11.140 --> 08:11.900
Huh?

08:21.360 --> 08:22.600
I'm fine.

08:22.600 --> 08:23.990
Fine.

08:28.580 --> 08:30.190
Here, Machi-san.

08:30.840 --> 08:32.210
You too, Fumio-san.

08:32.210 --> 08:33.480
Thank you.

08:34.330 --> 08:36.600
How many hankies do you even have?

08:38.000 --> 08:39.520
It's a spare.

08:42.690 --> 08:46.260
On my island, when we remember the departed,

08:46.260 --> 08:50.140
we all talk and pray together 
while gazing at the starry sky.

09:03.160 --> 09:08.910
I'm sure my predecessor was happy that 
everyone watched over her until the end.

09:09.410 --> 09:12.920
Tonight, let us pray for 
the repose of her soul.

09:15.880 --> 09:17.610
You must miss her, Shiori.

09:17.610 --> 09:20.340
She was especially fond of you.

09:21.990 --> 09:22.940
Yes.

09:23.900 --> 09:29.390
It was Grandmother who opened 
my eyes to a new world.

09:50.050 --> 09:52.340
Goshiki-san, is something wrong?

09:52.340 --> 09:53.230
No.

09:54.450 --> 09:59.180
It's lovely and invigorating to talk together
 this way beneath the blue sky, too.

10:02.300 --> 10:04.790
I like the idea of gathering at night.

10:04.790 --> 10:06.230
Thank you.

10:06.230 --> 10:11.590
My people are all of one heart, no matter 
how close or distant they may be.

10:11.840 --> 10:12.950
Your "people"?

10:14.490 --> 10:17.210
That's a sort of family tradition of ours.

10:19.210 --> 10:21.510
<i>I talked my way out of it again.</i>

10:32.950 --> 10:34.260
Oh, hey.

10:34.260 --> 10:38.860
I forgot to offer the manju buns, 
so I'm going to drop by again.

10:39.130 --> 10:41.990
Sorry, you can all go on ahead.

10:41.990 --> 10:44.540
Okay, got it. Can we play games?

10:44.540 --> 10:46.630
Sure thing. I'll be home soon.

10:47.220 --> 10:50.120
Chibi-chan, can I ask 
you to look after them?

10:50.360 --> 10:52.110
Sure, that's fine.

10:52.110 --> 10:54.320
Thanks a lot. See ya!

10:57.430 --> 11:00.920
Well, he needs some alone time, too.

11:00.920 --> 11:02.260
Let's go home, Goshiki-san.

11:03.340 --> 11:04.120
Huh?

11:08.270 --> 11:10.770
<i>Wonder if that seemed a bit forced.</i>

11:17.530 --> 11:18.790
Goshiki-san?

11:18.790 --> 11:21.280
Is it okay if I go with you?

11:21.530 --> 11:23.540
You could have just gone back.

11:23.540 --> 11:27.590
I'll leave if you prefer, 
but you looked sad.

11:29.740 --> 11:31.010
No, it's okay.

11:31.540 --> 11:32.840
Let's go together.

11:40.750 --> 11:43.750
Did your father have an illness?

11:44.150 --> 11:44.960
Yeah.

11:46.010 --> 11:48.300
It all happened so quickly.

11:49.000 --> 11:53.220
He would never complain, 
so we didn't realize until the end.

11:54.900 --> 11:57.230
If only he'd talked about it more.

12:02.490 --> 12:06.700
Earlier, you reported about 
Machi-san and Fumio-san.

12:06.700 --> 12:10.200
But it bugged me that nobody 
told him about you.

12:15.880 --> 12:20.080
I think Kuga-san is wonderful 
for supporting his siblings.

12:20.830 --> 12:27.200
Well, I'm not reliable like Dad, and I'm always
 worrying over whether I'm doing it right.

12:28.350 --> 12:31.920
There wasn't much good 
for me to report.

12:32.380 --> 12:35.200
What's an example of 
something that worries you?

12:36.440 --> 12:40.040
Are those worries something you can't share?

12:48.310 --> 12:50.320
It's still a little difficult.

12:50.870 --> 12:53.010
But thank you.

12:59.850 --> 13:03.070
I haven't done anything yet.

13:03.070 --> 13:05.980
No, I'm thankful for the sentiment.

13:08.350 --> 13:11.350
<b>Kuga Family Grave</b>

13:14.140 --> 13:17.120
The truth is, I only want to 
share the things that are good.

13:19.100 --> 13:23.630
But just being told it's okay to share the 
things that aren't good makes me happy.

13:24.720 --> 13:26.160
I see.

13:27.240 --> 13:28.850
And so, well...

13:28.850 --> 13:32.160
I did think of something else to report.

13:32.650 --> 13:34.620
That's why I came back.

13:34.620 --> 13:36.870
That's lovely!

13:40.680 --> 13:41.740
Dad.

13:42.640 --> 13:44.840
This is Shiori Goshiki-san.

13:48.440 --> 13:50.700
We're in a relationship.

13:53.820 --> 13:58.460
A-And I hope it lasts a long time!

14:03.670 --> 14:06.220
N-Nice to meet you!

14:10.900 --> 14:12.350
It's getting cooler.

14:12.850 --> 14:13.880
Want to go home?

14:13.880 --> 14:14.400
Yeah.

14:29.800 --> 14:32.310
<i>A-A long time?</i>

14:33.860 --> 14:35.950
<i>Now this feels like...</i>

14:40.780 --> 14:43.100
Ichiro, what did you want to discuss?

14:43.750 --> 14:46.560
Dad! This is Shiori Goshiki-san!

14:46.560 --> 14:48.950
I want to be in a relationship 
with her for a long time!

14:49.380 --> 14:52.190
Okay then. Be sure to make her happy.

14:52.470 --> 14:53.500
Happy.

14:56.460 --> 14:57.430
Huh?!

14:58.960 --> 15:00.220
Congratulations!

15:00.220 --> 15:01.790
Thanks!

15:00.220 --> 15:01.790
Bum-bum-bum!

15:01.790 --> 15:03.230
I'll be so happy!

15:04.660 --> 15:06.690
Calm down, me!

15:10.240 --> 15:12.160
Now I feel woozy.

15:20.450 --> 15:25.150
A-And I hope it lasts a long time!

15:30.180 --> 15:35.230
<i>Th-That kinda felt like you-know-what.</i>

15:32.610 --> 15:37.120
<b>father</b>

15:35.230 --> 15:36.760
We're an item!

15:43.080 --> 15:44.870
G-Goshiki-san?

15:48.410 --> 15:49.250
Huh?

15:49.630 --> 15:51.720
Your face looks red.

15:51.720 --> 15:55.750
I felt hot. Thought I'd have some water.

15:57.380 --> 15:58.960
You might have a fever.

15:59.950 --> 16:00.900
See?

16:01.250 --> 16:02.790
Get in bed.

16:02.790 --> 16:03.840
Water...

16:03.840 --> 16:05.140
I'll bring you some.

16:14.560 --> 16:16.190
Now get some rest.

16:16.190 --> 16:18.790
Th-Thank you.

16:21.480 --> 16:24.530
I wonder if she got sick 
because it suddenly got cool.

16:25.600 --> 16:27.250
Vitamins and hydration.

16:27.250 --> 16:29.560
Some rice gruel, if she can eat.

16:29.880 --> 16:31.520
And that leaves medicine.

16:33.930 --> 16:36.090
How does her health work?

16:36.920 --> 16:41.390
Is her stinger the only thing about her 
that's different from regular people?

16:41.900 --> 16:43.760
I should have asked.

16:50.600 --> 16:52.700
I'll lie down next to you.

17:01.370 --> 17:03.380
I want her to rely on me.

17:07.430 --> 17:10.720
Right, so let her get some rest.

17:11.410 --> 17:13.120
Can we do something to help?

17:13.120 --> 17:14.350
To help?

17:17.730 --> 17:19.330
<i>I hear voices.</i>

17:20.250 --> 17:24.340
It's okay. You two just keep 
warm and get some sleep.

17:24.340 --> 17:25.090
Okay.

17:26.790 --> 17:28.420
<i>Something smells good.</i>

17:31.840 --> 17:32.900
I'm coming in.

17:37.500 --> 17:39.270
I'll leave this here.

17:39.270 --> 17:41.140
Have some, if you think you can eat.

17:41.440 --> 17:44.370
Text me anytime if you need anything.

17:47.720 --> 17:49.940
Well, sorry to intrude.

17:57.520 --> 17:59.130
Just a little longer.

18:00.310 --> 18:02.040
S-Sure.

18:15.200 --> 18:16.450
The room.

18:20.080 --> 18:21.950
My room.

18:22.520 --> 18:23.290
Yes?

18:23.670 --> 18:25.450
It's very spacious.

18:25.450 --> 18:26.960
You mean back home.

18:27.430 --> 18:29.250
And quiet.

18:29.250 --> 18:33.320
Oh, but my people will 
come if I call to them.

18:33.320 --> 18:37.520
That's why, the first time I saw this one,

18:38.360 --> 18:41.080
I thought "What a lovely, small room."

18:44.310 --> 18:47.730
Even from the center, I feel 
like everything's within reach.

18:47.730 --> 18:49.370
Oh, I get it...

18:52.440 --> 18:55.900
Goshiki-san, you don't have 
to force yourself to talk.

18:57.400 --> 19:00.320
But we need to talk about something.

19:00.880 --> 19:02.600
Because I want you to stay.

19:08.770 --> 19:10.340
You don't have to say anything.

19:10.910 --> 19:12.260
I'll be right here.

19:14.600 --> 19:15.580
Are you sure?

19:16.750 --> 19:18.610
I am.

19:44.890 --> 19:46.400
I feel better!

19:49.780 --> 19:52.940
<i>I had him fall asleep in </i>that<i> position?!</i>

19:52.940 --> 19:54.780
<i>Was he like that all night?!</i>

19:58.040 --> 20:00.670
<i>That means we spent the night together!</i>

20:08.810 --> 20:11.790
Sorry! I didn't mean to doze off!

20:11.790 --> 20:15.450
It's okay! Thanks to you, 
I feel completely well now.

20:16.010 --> 20:17.930
Good, good.

20:17.930 --> 20:19.930
I'll be going, then.

20:19.930 --> 20:21.950
Thank you.

20:49.130 --> 20:51.120
I'm glad you feel better.

20:52.190 --> 20:53.000
Me, too.

21:00.980 --> 21:03.150
<i>Maybe this fever was a good thing.</i>

21:05.680 --> 21:07.590
Goshiki-san, are you okay?!

21:07.590 --> 21:08.870
You okay?

21:10.490 --> 21:13.220
Wh-What, you were up?

21:13.220 --> 21:15.250
G-Good morning!

21:15.250 --> 21:17.490
Goshiki-san, how do you feel?

21:18.070 --> 21:22.970
I'm all better, thanks.

21:23.260 --> 21:25.620
Oh, that's good!

21:25.620 --> 21:26.810
That's good.

21:26.810 --> 21:31.500
The way you came barging into the room, 
you must have been pretty worried.

21:31.500 --> 21:33.710
And what're you doing here, Ichiro?

21:34.400 --> 21:36.750
Oh, I just happened to...

21:36.750 --> 21:39.150
I was worried, too.

21:39.460 --> 21:42.640
Then that makes you the same as us!

21:44.230 --> 21:45.810
Oh, I know.

21:45.810 --> 21:48.410
I'll make breakfast. I bet you're hungry.

21:48.670 --> 21:49.900
I am!

21:49.900 --> 21:51.040
I am!

21:51.040 --> 21:54.910
You two can help me get ready, then.

21:54.910 --> 21:56.030
Okay.

21:58.890 --> 22:02.000
Your face is red, though. Are you okay?

22:02.290 --> 22:04.690
N-Never mind about me!

22:04.690 --> 22:06.490
Come on now, out!

22:06.490 --> 22:07.820
Weird.

22:07.820 --> 22:09.050
Weird.

22:16.060 --> 22:27.650
A long red thread stretching 
into the distance

22:27.650 --> 22:38.800
Meeting you, even if it meant having 
to cross hundreds of light-years

22:38.800 --> 22:45.480
Maybe I'll slowly get used to

22:45.480 --> 22:52.390
The two of us going out to have fun

22:52.390 --> 23:02.230
A tug on my arm, by the bond 
that was formed that day

23:02.230 --> 23:08.090
A little at a time, we've 
come closer together

23:08.090 --> 23:12.880
More smiles for us

23:12.880 --> 23:25.690
That place I first learned of, and 
the shops we'll visit again tomorrow

23:25.690 --> 23:31.650
They'll all be part of these lovely days

23:31.650 --> 23:38.490
Looking forward to it, good night

23:45.970 --> 23:47.780
Will it be Christmas soon?

23:47.780 --> 23:50.730
That's right! What present 
will you ask for, Fumio?

23:50.730 --> 23:51.910
A castle book.

23:51.910 --> 23:53.930
Nice! What about you, Chibi-chan?

23:53.930 --> 23:57.300
Me?! Um, um... it's a secret.

23:56.080 --> 24:00.030
<b><b>Episode 8</b></b>

23:56.080 --> 24:00.030
<b>Christmas with the Princess</b>

23:57.300 --> 23:59.170
Why are you so embarrassed?
